This folder contains all pertinent model runs and comparison graphics as used for the CIE review and described in the varios CIE documents.

The final SAFE assessment models are provided in the '_Final_Mods' folder.

The other folders contain the various models developed as part of the model building excercises or that were presented as sensitivity runs. 

The '1Reg_Mods' folder contains the single region models, including the results of both the single change (1-off) and stepwise model building from Model 25.12_1Reg_Cont to Model 26.1_1Reg.

The 'FAA_Mods' folder contains the Fleets-as-Areas (FAA) models, including Model 26.2_FAA.

The 'Spat_Mods' folder contains the final spatial models, including Model 26.3_5reg_Spat and Model 26.3a_3Reg_Spat.

MSE results are available from https://github.com/chengmatt/sablefish_cie_sims_2026.

Each model run folder contains the following sub-folders:
* plots -- all output plots including fits to data, time series values, diagnostics, and pdfs containing similar figures.
* Mod_Comp -- code to make graphics comparisons across models, including output figured and pdfs from running the code. 

Within each model run folder, the following files are provided:
* model_name.R -- this is the main r file for setting up and running the sablefish assessment in SPoRC, which includes code for setting up the model, running the model, outputting figures, doing residual analysis (OSA and Pearson), and running diagnostics (jitters, retrospectives, profile likelihoods).
* SPoRC_model_description.RDS -- the input data file that SPoRC reads in and uses to setup model structure and contains the observed data to be fit by the model.
* Model_model_name_setup.pdf -- a description of main model assumptions and data structure.
* model_name_input_list.RDS -- an R file containing a list produced by SPoRC containing all the input data and model setup.
* model_name_model_results.RDS -- an R file containing a list produced by SPoRC containing all the outputs and results.
* model_name_ABC_proj.RDS -- an R file containing a  list produced by SPoRC containing all the outputs from short-term catch (ABC) projections.
* model_name_mcmc.RDS -- an R file containing a  produced by SPoRC containing all the MCMC outputs and results (only available for certain models; large file).
* model_name.RDATA -- an R data file containing all the outputs and results from the given model run -- when loaded into an R session all outputs will be available, primarily as data frames (large file).


